    The BPT-to-MPT path is a licensed clinical route, not a skill you can pick up online — but inside that route, the fastest way to reach genuinely higher income is deliberately stacking a specialization, certifications, and a referral network on top of the base degree, not just waiting on seniority. That combination — the right specialization track plus proof of case volume plus an employer or referral network that pays for it — is what actually unlocks the higher end of this field's income range, and it is worth mapping before you pick a college, not after.
